{"steam_appid":3100370,"steam_name":"Black Jacket","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3100370/1468733886/c4a4a92911c349d943a85640db1327366095211b/1778169815/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1778174256","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257332989/19ff9229e1a6c24f5b3fc6f3b1c6ade1c631aa38/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1778174256","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/4d6e76579733c98b51d71d4ef54e0e959558d88e/ss_4d6e76579733c98b51d71d4ef54e0e959558d88e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785953660","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/ad3a12b97fa593f4edb770aaa48d6084c939aa2e/ss_ad3a12b97fa593f4edb770aaa48d6084c939aa2e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785953660","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/988e5c8a72b654a9a32ce0c5a2025fbe3b7f42be/ss_988e5c8a72b654a9a32ce0c5a2025fbe3b7f42be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785953660","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/9bab3fce25551c68a5f5d7061362c24e3409f7b1/ss_9bab3fce25551c68a5f5d7061362c24e3409f7b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785953660","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/253f56e841a7892fb471a304fd21a3bb7ef3236f/ss_253f56e841a7892fb471a304fd21a3bb7ef3236f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785953660"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The blackjack-inspired rogue-lite deck builder where you gamble your way out of hell, supercharge your deck and play impossible combos.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/c22e8492ba287ee545ccc1b7f724e957.poster.avif?t=1785953660\" aria-label=\"The mechanical variety of Black Jacket. \" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/c22e8492ba287ee545ccc1b7f724e957.webm?t=1785953660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLACKJACK EVOLVED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Black Jack against the restless souls wandering the hellish afterlife. You play for their coin, and you’ll need lots of them to bribe the ferryman and escape. But watch your bet because this isn’t your regular game of Black Jack:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your deck with powerful cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the table, bend the rules, and beat the odds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock near-infinite possibilities of card combinations and strategies with each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Artifacts, Card Suits, and Curses to get an edge over your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your opponents, their stories, and yourself to break the cycle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/b461d2b025cb4fe3784e6c7c1f7a2166.poster.avif?t=1785953660\" aria-label=\"Deckbuilding options throughout your runs\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/b461d2b025cb4fe3784e6c7c1f7a2166.webm?t=1785953660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWERFUL CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cards will bend and change the rules of the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force your opponent to overcommit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase and decrease their card values</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control their deck or peek into your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap cards with your opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secret combinations within your deck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/2cfa5d73929cfde116bb3345fca72c0f.poster.avif?t=1785953660\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/2cfa5d73929cfde116bb3345fca72c0f.webm?t=1785953660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >READ YOUR OPPONENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to read your opponents and listen to their story unfold with every encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opponents are shown only through their hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarize yourself with their playstyle and curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your relationship with them to break the cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/59784315202ba7e14136bd2e93a2fc89.poster.avif?t=1785953660\" aria-label=\"Silhouettes of different bosses you meet during your games.\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100370/extras/59784315202ba7e14136bd2e93a2fc89.webm?t=1785953660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 with release date 2014 or later OR AMD FX with release date 2013 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with base frequency 400 MHz or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Core i5 with release date 2014 or later OR AMD FX with release date 2015 or later<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Mi'pu'mi Games GmbH"],"publishers":["Skystone Games"],"release_date":"12 May, 2026"}